How was it? Did you feel my love?

465
00:51:31,323 --> 00:51:35,823
Oh, look at that! It's the specially prepared bedroom! Cute, isn't it?

466
00:51:36,063 --> 00:51:41,503
It has a bed, a sofa, Udin... And I don't know if you noticed, but...

467
00:51:41,783 --> 00:51:47,683
There was a display photo of the people I cherish the most in there! Did you catch it?

468
00:51:49,043 --> 00:51:52,383
I think the neon stage was really cool, too!

469
00:51:52,523 --> 00:51:55,663
You probably spotted a bunch of TVs sitting around.

470
00:51:55,923 --> 00:52:01,103
And well, those are there to help me watch you from afar~!

471
00:52:02,843 --> 00:52:04,383
Cool, right?

472
00:52:05,323 --> 00:52:11,183
Uh, but come to think of it, I really did drag you around the stages, huh?

473
00:52:11,923 --> 00:52:17,183
Um, how are you? Do you feel sick? Are you okay? You're not tired?

474
00:52:18,103 --> 00:52:22,963
I'm a bit worried, but I think it shouldn't affect you too much since I carried you while you were still sleeping...

475
00:52:23,283 --> 00:52:30,003
Ha? What? Ngga' - koki? Ollie nggak ngomong apa-apa! Ah, sou ieba!
Huh? What? No, koki? Ollie didn't say anything! Ah, come to think of it!

476
00:52:30,923 --> 00:52:34,943
Eh, speaking of you, you kept running and hiding away from me!

477
00:52:35,083 --> 00:52:38,503
Naughty, naughty! Task - kask!

478
00:52:38,863 --> 00:52:45,783
You always leave comments and likes on every post I make, so I thought you'd like it if I came to visit!

479
00:52:45,923 --> 00:52:48,883
I didn't think you would actually surprise you that much.

480
00:52:50,863 --> 00:52:55,663
I think maybe it was because you were too surprised when I suddenly appeared in front of you?

481
00:52:56,803 --> 00:53:04,383
Yeah... But, just so you know, I worked really hard, just for you!

482
00:53:05,303 --> 00:53:10,943
I practiced my singing, I sang a lot, and changed my outfit so many times!

483
00:53:11,223 --> 00:53:15,423
And I wonder if my feelings reached you...

484
00:53:16,143 --> 00:53:18,363
It obviously did, right?

485
00:53:19,143 --> 00:53:23,623
Also, at the end, I finally managed to catch you!

486
00:53:23,923 --> 00:53:27,583
That's what you hoped for, right? I mean, cuz you were running away from me...

487
00:53:27,903 --> 00:53:34,303
...because you love me a lot! Obviously you were expecting it too, right?

488
00:53:36,423 --> 00:53:39,283
Period! Anyways...

489
00:53:39,923 --> 00:53:45,603
For those of you who are still watching — thank you by the way — I have an announcement!

490
00:53:46,083 --> 00:53:52,683
I'll be featured in SO87's song, Love Me Back, complete with the music video!

491
00:53:53,503 --> 00:53:58,223
It's going to be so cool, so keep an eye out, okay? Mm-hmm!

492
00:53:59,363 --> 00:54:02,403
Ah, it's just so exciting, isn't it?

493
00:54:02,663 --> 00:54:10,543
If you ever feel the need to feel my love again, then don't hesitate and please come back to watch the 3D Birthday Live again, okay?

494
00:54:12,223 --> 00:54:16,563
I'll always be here waiting for you.

495
00:54:17,843 --> 00:54:22,083
Anyways, Bye-bye! Otsucrazy~!

